   "label": "School Committee minutes, 2026-06-24",
   "quote": "Field hockey and track, they are using hand me down jerseys, field hockey had 11 games last year and one official per game at $50 per official. Track had zero officials, the coaches were the officials and they are using hand me down jerseys from varsity."
  },
  {
   "board": "School Committee",
   "date": "2026-06-24",
   "href": "/docs/minutes/text/school-committee/2026-06-24-minutes-7869.txt",
   "label": "School Committee minutes, 2026-06-24",
   "quote": "I don’t know how track costs anything other than overhead allocations, which I would call programmatic cost."
  },
  {
   "board": "School Committee",
   "date": "2026-06-24",
   "href": "/docs/minutes/text/school-committee/2026-06-24-minutes-7869.txt",
